---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy — dshbase"
  description="dshbase privacy policy."
  currentPath="/privacy/"
>
  <section class="info wrap">
    <h1>Privacy <span class="accent">policy</span></h1>
    <p>dshbase is a static informational website. It does not have accounts, does not collect personal data, and does not store anything you type.</p>
    <h2>What we don't collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>No user accounts, no sign-ups, no forms.</li>
      <li>No cookies beyond what the hosting/CDN may set.</li>
      <li>No personal data storage.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>This site is served by Cloudflare Pages, which may log standard request metadata (IP, user agent) for security and caching, per their privacy policy.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:hello@dshbase.com">hello@dshbase.com</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>
